{"id":"fng1x7mx1kjawbnei8t5ogoxz","title":"德国立法机构通过非刑事加密资产冻结法案","originalTitle":"German lawmakers back crypto freezes outside criminal cases","summary":"德国立法机构通过法案，允许在未启动刑事调查的情况下冻结价值超10万欧元的加密货币及其他高价值资产。此前德国已通过Movie2k侵权案没收近5万枚BTC，新规将举证责任转移至持有者，并面临法律争议。法案预计2027年生效。","reason":"该政策将举证责任转移至加密货币持有者，可能影响跨境资产流动的合规成本。","source":{"name":"Cointelegraph"},"links":{"original":"https://cointelegraph.com/news/german-lawmakers-back-crypto-freezes-outside-criminal-cases?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T22:46:44.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T04:24:38.646Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T04:24:38.646Z","category":"crypto-policy","tags":["监管处罚","政策发布","SEC"],"score":86,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"Cointelegraph by Bryan O'Shea","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"sec","name":"SEC / 美国证监会"},{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}